# Matches docs/architecture/indentation.md: tabs four wide, spaces for the
# alignment under an open bracket, and no indent for a namespace body.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
UseTab: ForIndentation
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
NamespaceIndentation: None
AccessModifierOffset: -4
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine: true
AlignAfterOpenBracket: Align
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
PointerAlignment: Left
SortIncludes: false
